# Dependencies
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

# Cloud Functions has no other pin on its transitive tree (several deps declare
# @types/node as "*"), so an uncommitted lockfile let it silently drift to an
# incompatible version (P7.2-A/B). Committed here as a deliberate, scoped
# exception to the repo-wide no-lockfile convention above — not extended to
# the other subprojects.
!japanese-alchemy-hosting/functions/package-lock.json

